  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Astrid slashes her Blade of Woe at Monika.
  - Astrid morphs into a spectre of darkness, stabbing at Monika using her death
    art.
  - Astrid opens a portal to the void above Monika's head, dropping woe down upon
    her.
  - Astrid's dark spectre splits, surrounding Monika and slashing at her.
  - Astrid's spectre merges into one again, combining her death art with the still
    open void portal.
  - Astrid's spectre form flattens like a shadow, stabbing at Monika's ankles.
  - Astrid's spectre splits again, all of them slashing at Monika at once.
