  - Astrid slashes at Monika using her death art. Again.
  - Astrid opens a portal to the void. Again.
  - Astrid splits into multiple spectres. Again.
  - Astrid opens a portal mixed with her death art. Again.
  - Astrid slashes at Monika's ankles. Again.
  - Astrid splits into multiple coordinated spectres. Again.
