  defeatText: The leader of the Dark Brotherhood has been slain; the first (technically
    second) step in purifying Tamriel of her vile guild's dark influence.
  nameText: Astrid
  blurbText: She's the leader of the bunch, you know her well- Thi-thi-this this
    Kong is going to <b>hell</b>!
